      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INDY GIA (1) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing second (26.13) at this track. Goes very well at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Comes through a solid form race last start. Racing well and deserves a win. PACK LEADER (3) hit the ground running from out wide last start and crossed down to lead throughout (19.67) at this track in a Grade 5 over 340m. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. HIGHGATE NELLY (2) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (30.47) at Launceston. Expected to feature again. TAKE OFF TWIGGY (7) looks an each-way chance.",
